  "description": "<p>When using the import-export-utility, the utility will fail to import a bag when the directory passed in is of the form '<tt>./path-to-bag</tt>'. When using a relative path like this, the path's representation looks like <tt>/storage/bags/./path-to-bag</tt> which causes a MaliciousPathException to occur when the bagit-java library attempts to read the bag.</p>",
